WEBVTT

00:16:26.912 --> 00:16:32.912
And I was a teenager and I wanted
to be pretty and popular

00:16:33.329 --> 00:16:37.287
and not associated with going to
the bathroom in an outhouse

00:16:38.579 --> 00:16:42.246
or taking a bath in a pond,
which is what I did.

00:16:43.329 --> 00:16:46.496
Or taking a bath in a bucket,
which is what I did.

00:16:46.746 --> 00:16:52.246
So, yeah, my my rebellion in my
teen years was to seem to be

00:16:52.996 --> 00:16:57.621
a version of myself that thought that I
wanted to project a sense of success

00:16:57.954 --> 00:16:59.996
and grace and togetherness.